{"version":1,"content":"<p>有關蘋果下一代入門級智能手機的爆料信息再次浮現。最新消息顯示，計劃於2027年發佈的iPhone 18e可能會與標準版iPhone 18採用相同的大容量電池設計，這意味着蘋果或將進一步縮小兩款機型之間的硬件差距。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585638.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.410552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T14:24:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"c9afe0314968ab59ba479e5ce6a6e16e9907f0a5a8a6276bdd9ea5294881c970","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}